member.summary:
Compatibility endpoint for demo:
GET /api/Login/payment-status/{sessionId}/{paymentHash}
It just ignores the sessionId and forwards the hash to the original logic.

L402-Gated MCP Proxy Middleware

Validates L402 tokens and forwards requests to registered MCP servers.

Usage: Register MCP proxy via /api/mcpproxy, then access via /mcp/{path}
